 "face": {
  "mode": "baked",
  "note": "The eyes are glossy lenses (lo_eyes) with the sky-blue iris, pupil, catchlights and the upper lash band baked into the atlas; the dark brow strokes, the eye-liner wing, the brow star cluster, the nose and the smile are baked into the body. No face sheet and no morphs: expressions in clips' `faces` are hints only. Blinking scales the blink bones (play `blink` over any clip): each lens squashes onto the closed lid's lash line and sinks into the head, showing the closed lid sculpted and painted under it. The mane's locks and the plume's clumps are sculpted into the body under hair cards; the coat's stars and constellations are baked into the atlas and its glow mask; the tail star is a fin (lo_fins) and glows with its own colour.",
